  "manufacturer": "BigTreeTech",
  "description": "BigTreeTech's TMC5160T Pro V1.0 StepStick-form driver. BigTreeTech describes it as \"a high-power stepper motor driver control chip that uses external power MOSFETs\", with an 8–56 V supply range and an enhanced-fin heatsink. A later V1.1 revision exists in the BigTreeTech repository but has no dedicated documentation page; all specs here reflect the documented V1.0 baseline.",
